  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle. Half-fill a medium saucepan with the boiling water.\n• Add basmati rice and a pinch of salt and cook, uncovered, over high heat until tender, 12 minutes. Drain and return to the saucepan.\n• In a medium bowl, add haloumi and cover with water. Soak for 5 minutes.\n• Pat haloumi dry with a paper towel and cut into 2cm cubes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6796bdff827da247caecc2db-29dc0a1d.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat and cook haloumi until golden brown, 3-4 minutes. Set aside on a plate.\n• While haloumi is cooking, finely chop brown onion and garlic.\n• Roughly chop capsicum.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6796bdff827da247caecc2db-5e07777b.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Add onion and capsicum and cook, tossing, until softened, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add mild North Indian spice blend, Mumbai spice blend and garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Add passata, the water, brown sugar and butter and simmer until slightly thickened, 1-2 minutes.\n• Remove pan from heat, then add baby spinach leaves, Greek-style yoghurt and return haloumi to the pan. Stir until combined. Season to taste with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6796bdff827da247caecc2db-dabdb672.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide rapid rice between bowls.\n• Top with haloumi and veggie tikka curry.\n• Tear over coriander to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6796bdff827da247caecc2db-4d0ce10a.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
